The Forge — public slice
==============================================

This repository publishes the architecture, selected control code, a reduced
demo pipeline, a recorded demo and evidence for portfolio and
defensive-disclosure purposes. The public pipeline is a subset of the full one:
the major stages plus one deterministic stage, not the full step table.

It does not publish, and does not grant any licence to, the private
implementation: the full pipeline and its tuned control policies, the
integration machinery, the scoring rubric, model routing, retry tuning, the
evaluation corpus, hidden tests or golden transcripts remain private. Prompts
and prompt fragments are also not published.

The demo was produced from a real unattended run. Absolute paths in the captured
TUI frames were redacted before rendering. No user data, credentials or private
repository contents are included.

